[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 60.349, "timestamp": "00:01:00", "text": "事情都讓我很煩躁，我需要先休息一下。現在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 61.349, "timestamp": "00:01:01", "text": "是早上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 62.99, "timestamp": "00:01:02", "text": "9點，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 68.83, "timestamp": "00:01:08", "text": "所以事情真的很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 74.35, "timestamp": "00:01:14", "text": "總之，今天我們要進行一些「守衛」（Warding）活動，我會選擇「守衛」（Ward）這個名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 77.95, "timestamp": "00:01:17", "text": "我們今天要做的是：第一，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 80.429, "timestamp": "00:01:20", "text": "我會做一些「警告」（Warning）之類的活動；第二，我會聽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 83.149, "timestamp": "00:01:23", "text": "音樂或做點別的；第三，我會玩遊戲；第四，我會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 86.59, "timestamp": "00:01:26", "text": "做一些其他的事情，例如基於時間的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 89.55, "timestamp": "00:01:29", "text": "自動化活動。別擔心，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 91.35, "timestamp": "00:01:31", "text": "我們拭目以待。這就是今天的三個目標，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 94.99000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:34", "text": "我們會努力完成的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 98.41, "timestamp": "00:01:38", "text": "好的，大家一起來吧！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 105.35, "timestamp": "00:01:45", "text": "這裡。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 108.03, "timestamp": "00:01:48", "text": "讓我找一下鏈接，看看能不能用。是的，"}]